What's new in EzySplit 2.4

• No more surprise balances: edited expenses are tagged, and changes made after a settle-up are flagged with a full change log
• "Changes since settle-up" on Balances shows exactly what moved and why
• New monthly insight: your top category and how you compare with last month
• Cleaner Quick stats, with personal-only stats on the Personal tab
• Redesigned PDF reports and a more useful Excel export
